WEBVTT

00:37:58.746 --> 00:38:01.704
All my Mets fans, friends, I'm joking.
I don't know if you are, but go on.

00:38:02.246 --> 00:38:04.329
I'm joking anyway. I know
I keep going, please.

00:38:04.371 --> 00:38:06.246
Well, no. So I thought this
idea of just, you know,

00:38:06.246 --> 00:38:10.079
considering the possibility that we could
hold different views all of a sudden,

00:38:10.079 --> 00:38:12.954
it it just destabilizes a
lot of the stereotypes

00:38:12.954 --> 00:38:14.663
and prejudices that people hold.

00:38:15.038 --> 00:38:19.621
And so, as you know, we ran these really
entertaining experiments where we gave

00:38:19.621 --> 00:38:21.413
people a chance to to punish fans of

00:38:21.413 --> 00:38:24.663
the opposing team by giving
them extra spicy hot sauce

00:38:25.288 --> 00:38:28.371
or by giving them really difficult
math problems,

00:38:28.579 --> 00:38:31.496
which were actually going to hurt their
payment for participating in the study.